<section class="card mt16"><h2>确认关联已有付款</h2><div class="stats stats-3"><div><span class="muted">已有资金扣款</span><p class="amount"><%= helpers.money(preview.original_outflow_cents) %></p></div><div><span class="muted">整理后资金扣款</span><p class="amount"><%= helpers.money(preview.new_outflow_cents) %></p></div><div><span class="muted">整理后费用支出</span><p class="amount"><%= helpers.money(preview.new_expense_cents) %></p></div></div><p class="help"><%= preview.mode==='link'?'已有转账保持原样，仅添加付款关联与核销。':'原银行扣款会标记为已替换，转换为本金转账与实际费用，避免重复记支出。' %>来源记录：<%= preview.source_ids.join('、') %>。</p><form method="post" action="/finance/<%= target %>/payments"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="confirm_sources" value="1"><% Object.entries(params).filter(([k])=>!['_csrf','confirm_sources'].includes(k)).forEach(([k,v])=>{ %><input type="hidden" name="<%= k %>" value="<%= typeof v==='object'?JSON.stringify(v):v %>"><% }); %><button class="btn btn-primary">确认关联，资金不重复记账</button></form></section>
